DRIVER_ERROR: connection refused (os error 61)
next: the driver is unreachable; work through this checklist:
  - is `agent-mobile serve` running on the Mac? (any verb can lazy-start it)
  - is the development certificate still trusted on the device?
    re-trust lives in Settings > General > VPN & Device Management
  - are the device and the Mac on the same Wi-Fi network?
  - is the Mac awake? sleep drops the driver
certificate re-trust is human-only; there is no retry loop
